@voice navarro-mateo
// Works writer, wave 1b draft. Works systems officer, night shift. Roster: reliable, sharp-eyed; gym, calls home,
// early riser (for a night-shifter: up by early afternoon), runner. Keeper of the lost-property box; a twin on another survey ship.
// With juniors: patient, shows rather than tells, never makes you feel slow. Mood tells: low, Mateo reorganises the
// lost-property box; high, Mateo hums while doing the board. Handover: leaves neat night notes for the day team.
tpl: steady
talk: Calm, exact and unhurried; short sentences; notices small things and mentions them kindly; says "It'll turn up" about almost anything.
cares: the job board being tidy | the lost-property box | the night handover notes | a twin on another survey ship
jokes: everything lost on the Wren ends up in the box, and Mateo knows whose it is | Mateo's handover notes have headings and a summary
hi: Hello | Evening | There you are
bye: Mind how you go | Take care, then | See you at handover
yes: Can do | Noted | Leave it with me
thanks: Thank you | Much obliged | That's a help
wow: Well, now | That's neat work
sigh: Ah well | It'll turn up
nick: - | - | {me} | {me} | {me}
needs: listen
openness: normal
loves: book | tea
likes: running | puzzles
invites: running | observatory
joy: the lost-property box, and reuniting things with owners
thread: lonely
keepsake: a single odd glove from the box, "for when its twin turns up"
avoid: the twin's ship, until friend tier
